[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Seperated</h2>
<i>"Don't break a bunch sticks all at once...break them one at a time."<br>
-- Paul Freen the Insane (on the odd Tuesdays)</i>  
<p>It seems your asention to power is not unrivaled....many are fighting over ultimate control.  The Duke of Thunder has been seperated from you and the Knight if Wind.  You must save him and destroy your competion.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You have won this battle but many more are to come if you will to be the ruler of this world.

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron2


[ai3PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Kalin of Rain</h2>
<p>
This is just slight setback.

[ai3TempleDead]
<h2>Message from the Kalin of Rain</h2>
<p>
Blast you!  My defences have failed..

[ai4PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Wern of Thunder</h2>
<p>
I suppose I was my ambitions were too high..

[ai3TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Duke of Thunder</h2>
<p>
I'm being overwhelmed!!  Some help would be nice.

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Duke of Thunder has died!</h2>
<p>
Seems you were unable to help him once seperated from your island.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai7TempleDead]
<h2>Message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
They have destroyed my Temple!!!

[ai7PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Knight of Wind has died!</h2>
<p>
In your efforts to help the Duke, the Knight of Wind fell.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You were so close to being the ruler of all......but you have fallen right before the finish.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]


